# ============================================================
#  Model weights
#  UPLOADED (through Git LFS, see .gitattributes):
#    pretrained ACGPN networks G, G1, G2, U in checkpoints/label2city/
#    (the _2 folder holds identical files; Git LFS stores them only once)
#  NOT uploaded: every other .pth file, e.g. the VGG-19 loss network
#    (public download, see README)
# ============================================================
*.pth
!ACGPN_inference/checkpoints/label2city/latest_net_*.pth
!ACGPN_inference_2/checkpoints/label2city/latest_net_*.pth

